<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
<h1>Congratulations! You're Invited by <%= @resource.organization.name %></h1>
<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>
<p>You have been invited to join <strong>HIPAA Checker</strong>! </p>
<p>HIPAA Checker helps to ensure your applications are HIPAA-compliant by providing automated and reliable compliance checks</p>
<p>Please click the link below to accept the invitation:</p>
<p>
  <a href="https://hipaachecker.health/sign-up?invitation_token=<%= @token %>&organization_name=<%= @resource&.organization&.name %>">
    Accept Invitation
  </a>
</p>
<p>If you did not expect this invitation, please ignore this email.</p>
<p>Thank you,</p>
<p>HIPAA Checker Team</p>
</body>
</html>